# Yellow Bluff concept

Frontend-only Vue 3 pitch mock for Dental Care on Yellow Bluff (Jacksonville, FL). Not the live site. No backend, booking, insurance checker, search, or live chat.

**Lookup doc:** [docs/project.md](docs/project.md) — architecture, tokens, change map.

**Live:** https://rezorio.github.io/yellow-bluff-concept/

## Edit map

- Colors/type → `src/style.css` + `index.html` fonts
- Phone/hours/address → `src/data/practice.js`
- Doctors/services/nav → `src/data/*.js` (do not hardcode in views)
- Pages → `src/views/` + `src/components/`
- Keep the concept banner on every page

Vue 3 `<script setup>`, Tailwind v4 tokens (`bg-brand`, `font-serif`), Lucide via `@lucide/vue`.
